    "UIFlow/小智是固定Git板树的范围化调查，生成检查收据不冒称HTTP响应：{\"uiflow\": \"固定提交a61a29409f09f1f4bebae05e15c4bd6dcc4956b6板树中无Waveshare命名目录；此检索范围不证明不存在第三方移植。\", \"xiaozhi\": \"固定提交92d400d6374bbe750e0a0188fa969fc4042820c2板树已检索；未建立此精确SKU的可直接运行镜像。\"}",
    "模型来源和几何范围：waveshare-esp32-s3-lcd-1-3-b；model-plan.json保留原始参考、尺寸、图像像素/UV及UNKNOWN边界。",
    "模型逐项边界：Official structure RAR contains a partial native board model with38 source components. All are preserved, including its true PCB; source missing large packages, USB shell, optical body and standoff heights remain UNKNOWN. Manufacturer source CAD is not silently promoted to a complete assembly.；23.4x23.4mm source display window and unchanged front photograph provide the optical reference.25.0x28.9mm glass outline/position are image estimates; board-to-glass offset1.2mm is an explicit visualization estimate, not native assembly fit. No fake component layout replaces known CAD.；Native case-base241124 is a single real open-front hollow printed component,28.644873x31.62x12.3mm. Unit-scale rigid rotation/centering only. Source photograph28.65x31.75x12.55mm differs slightly; no scaling to hide that difference. Case-to-board registration is approximate, not native assembly transform."
